The bug was caused by the lack of thread safety in the request handler registry, which led to potential race conditions when multiple threads attempted to register or access request handlers concurrently. This was particularly problematic because the methods related to registration were documented to be thread-safe, but the underlying implementation did not support this, resulting in inconsistent behavior and possible application errors.

